    CPMAddPackage(
      NAME flashinfer
      GITHUB_REPOSITORY flashinfer-ai/flashinfer
      GIT_TAG v0.6.15
      GIT_SHALLOW TRUE
      DOWNLOAD_ONLY YES)

and the carried files were copied from the tree that command produced --
