This section is new. The XQA text has been in the tree since the XQA lattice
landed and its `LICENSE` came with it, but no NOTICE entry named it -- the
document described FlashInfer's `include/flashinfer/` closure and stopped
there, and `csrc/xqa/` is a different directory of the same checkout that
